  "description": "FAPPIW crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C168 H254 La4 O13. From the CIF bond table, La1 (La) has 6 O neighbors; La2 (La) has 6 O neighbors; La1E (La) has 6 O neighbors; La2E (La) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.803-5.444 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.86-180.00°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [La4(OC6H3But2-3,5)12(OH2)].",
